    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.11_base_commutative_diagram.chapters.02_typed_legs_and_atlas.sections.03_diagram_atlas.concrete_anchor_8_vetclassifies#vet_classifies" .
silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_02_typed_legs_and_atlas_sections_03_diagram_atlas_concrete_anchor_8_vetclassifies#vet_classifies silm:hasLongDescription "The vet_classifies is the vet typed verb-arrow taking Mittens to Cat (classification leg c). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'vet_classifies', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
